sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Utilisateur
  participant UI as React
  participant AC as AuthController
  participant J as JwtService
  participant DB as MySQL
  U->>UI: username + mot de passe
  UI->>AC: POST /api/auth/login
  AC->>DB: findByUsername
  AC->>AC: BCrypt matches
  AC->>J: generate(username, role)
  AC-->>UI: 200 {token, role}
  UI->>UI: stocke la session
  UI->>AC: requêtes suivantes avec Authorization Bearer
